  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palm Oil Transformation Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Palm oil production and processing Beneficiaries: 184 (62 women) Description: The Project will build the financial and administrative capacity of the organization to better enable the expansion of the company&apos;s oil palm production and processing activities. The Project funds will be used for: construction of a storage and office facility and three collection centers; palm oil fruits and nuts processing machinery and packaging materials, trainings in financial and administrative skills along with technical agricultural trainings, technical staff salaries, a motorcycle, crop purchase funds, an administrative procedures manual and business plan, and initial project start up costs.</narrative>
  </description>
